# .cursorrules — Cursor Agent Rules for AEGIS Framework

# Refer to the canonical AI integration document:
# docs/ai/integration.md

# Non-Negotiable Safety Rules:
# 1. Never bypass policy evaluation or approval gates.
# 2. Never enable Autonomy Level 4 (supported: 0, 1, 2, 3).
# 3. Never execute arbitrary shell strings as remediation actions.
# 4. Never disable fail-closed security.
# 5. Always use Aegis.from_config("aegis.yaml") or explicit dependency injection.
# 6. Never commit secrets; use ${VAR:default} env interpolation.
